    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infernity: The Devil's Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Devil\u2019s Arena Awaits You!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the darkest corners of Hell. <i>Infernity: The Devil\u2019s Arena</i> throws you into a war that doesn\u2019t end, even after death. Gladiators who lost their lives in the real world are now bound to serve the Devil, doomed to fight endlessly in a hellish arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face ruthless enemies in dark, gothic, dungeon-themed arenas. Survive, claim victory, and collect rewards. As the Devil watches you from his throne, your fate depends entirely on his whim. Sometimes you\u2019ll be rewarded other times, punished with fresh waves of enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Bloody and Dynamic Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight in deadly arenas, each with its own dark theme and deadly traps. Use your strategy and make the most of advantageous positions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demonic Rewards &amp; Punishments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every glance at the Devil\u2019s throne brings uncertainty. He may grant you a reward or unleash an army of skeletons upon you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Create Your Own Gladiator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character\u2019s appearance, level up your skills, and equip powerful weapons to dominate the battlefield.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/9cf9948f66c84917d647843190546d5a.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/9cf9948f66c84917d647843190546d5a.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/9cf9948f66c84917d647843190546d5a.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; Local Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight alone, or team up with a friend on the same screen. The game does not include online multiplayer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/81f40a74799e44659d3482003608a73f.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/81f40a74799e44659d3482003608a73f.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/81f40a74799e44659d3482003608a73f.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/c7ea5a2dd897ca8cc4488f49e7e1e20f.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/c7ea5a2dd897ca8cc4488f49e7e1e20f.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/c7ea5a2dd897ca8cc4488f49e7e1e20f.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Advanced Lobby System: Araf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new abilities, upgrade your stats, and buy new gear in the purgatory-themed hub called <i>Araf</i>. Prepare yourself thoroughly before stepping into the arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lobby.gif</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress with Skull Coins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn skull-engraved coins at the end of each battle. Use them to power up your character, unlock new arenas, and purchase stronger weapons to move closer to victory.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Unlock Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain XP after each match to unlock new arenas. As your level increases, the difficulty rises and even the audience becomes a crowd of skeletons.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Terrifying Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game\u2019s visual style reflects the gothic and threatening aesthetic of Hell. Every corner hides a demonic danger.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mana-Powered Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use special abilities during combat to gain an edge but be careful how you manage your mana!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Trap-Filled Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefields are filled with spiked traps and dangerous terrain. Stay alert, protect yourself, and lure your enemies into their doom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Release Date &amp; Roadmap</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist: Support the game ahead of its Steam release by adding it to your favorites!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next Fest Participation (June): We\u2019ll be featured in Steam Next Fest this June with exclusive content and surprises!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Infernity to your wishlist now and let the dark arena shape your fate.</strong><br><strong> Survive, entertain the Devil\u2014and become the King of Hell!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infernity: The Devil's Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Devil\u2019s Arena Awaits You!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the darkest corners of Hell. <i>Infernity: The Devil\u2019s Arena</i> throws you into a war that doesn\u2019t end, even after death. Gladiators who lost their lives in the real world are now bound to serve the Devil, doomed to fight endlessly in a hellish arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face ruthless enemies in dark, gothic, dungeon-themed arenas. Survive, claim victory, and collect rewards. As the Devil watches you from his throne, your fate depends entirely on his whim. Sometimes you\u2019ll be rewarded other times, punished with fresh waves of enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/fccfdd9eb71482aa19f4b9b7f3832aa0.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Bloody and Dynamic Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight in deadly arenas, each with its own dark theme and deadly traps. Use your strategy and make the most of advantageous positions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/e6be62823182e5c7a59f865a27370ea8.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demonic Rewards &amp; Punishments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every glance at the Devil\u2019s throne brings uncertainty. He may grant you a reward or unleash an army of skeletons upon you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/872c28c106f4f145aa988e2936517950.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Create Your Own Gladiator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character\u2019s appearance, level up your skills, and equip powerful weapons to dominate the battlefield.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/9cf9948f66c84917d647843190546d5a.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/9cf9948f66c849