uy new gear in the purgatory-themed hub called <i>Araf</i>. Prepare yourself thoroughly before stepping into the arena.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lobby.gif</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress with Skull Coins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn skull-engraved coins at the end of each battle. Use them to power up your character, unlock new arenas, and purchase stronger weapons to move closer to victory.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Unlock Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain XP after each match to unlock new arenas. As your level increases, the difficulty rises and even the audience becomes a crowd of skeletons.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark and Terrifying Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game\u2019s visual style reflects the gothic and threatening aesthetic of Hell. Every corner hides a demonic danger.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mana-Powered Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use special abilities during combat to gain an edge but be careful how you manage your mana!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/ff1e37e25d0fd6a27c7f45b99af7d396.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Trap-Filled Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefields are filled with spiked traps and dangerous terrain. Stay alert, protect yourself, and lure your enemies into their doom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.poster.avif?t=1749464812\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.webm?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397940/extras/1325ea0e1eb0c896253692eaa75123a0.mp4?t=1749464812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Release Date &amp; Roadmap</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist: Support the game ahead of its Steam release by adding it to your favorites!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next Fest Participation (June): We\u2019ll be featured in Steam Next Fest this June with exclusive content and surprises!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Infernity to your wishlist now and let the dark arena shape your fate.</strong><br><strong> Survive, entertain the Devil\u2014and become the King of Hell!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
